{
  "id": "perceptual-training",
  "term": "perceptual training",
  "definition": "Perceptual training is a method used to change perceptual sensitivity by having people judge whether stimuli occur at the same time or not, while receiving feedback on their performance. In this context, it has been used to shift perceived simultaneity toward an optimum and narrow the temporal binding window.",
